        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 2, The Bridge, T.F. Maher Street, Dungarvan, X35FY56\r\n2 Bed | 1 Bath | FIRST FLOOR | Excellent Condition\r\nSuperb two-bedroom, two bathroom first floor apartment presented in excellent condition and ideally located in the heart of Dungarvan town.\r\nThis bright and spacious property benefits from a well-designed layout. The apartment also comes with the added advantage of a secure underground parking space and a separate storage unit.\r\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a generous open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, two spacious bedrooms with one ensuite, and a main bathroom.\r\nSituated in a prime town centre location, all amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and transport links are within immediate walking distance.\r\nThis property will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike."
